## What the patch is
The byte-exact forward diff `git diff 345eaaa 050c9c9 -- triggarr/web/routes.py`
(the whole commit; it touches only this file). It adds the unauthenticated
password-reset request flow, which mints a reset token and logs it at WARNING.
The existing, unchanged logging pipeline copies every WARNING into the in-app
log buffer that authenticated web pages render.

